      "i": 16,
      "lines": [
        50,
        52
      ],
      "raw": "* Your handler must be idempotent - the same event may be delivered more than once.\n* Respond with `HTTP 200` to acknowledge receipt. Modulr will retry on failure.\n* The `customerId` remains constant across the customer's lifetime on Modulr, even when new Application IDs are generated for CDD refresh cycles.",
